Black dragons give disintegration resistance, so I'd rely on their
corpses rather than armor.  Magic resistance is much better to have.

I always wish for blessed +3 gray dragon scale mail nowadays, although
it's TONS easier to get scale mail nowadays.  Kill the dragon.  If he's
carrying "a set of gray dragon scales", pick it up and put it on, removing
all other armor.  Then read a scroll of enchant armor.

Make sure you get a blessed bag of holding.  Twice as good.

Strength is easy to get, so I would get gauntlets of dex.

I believe getting a ring of levitation might be much better than boots,
since you can still wear your speed boots while using the ring.  Of
course, you might need those rings of searching, stealth, and teleport
control...

Other things I definitely consider wishing for:

blessed shield of reflection
